{"audio": "galatians-06.opus", "duration_ms": 125218, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2040, "end_ms": 3340, "text": "Galatians, Chapter Six."}, {"start_ms": 4781, "end_ms": 10882, "text": "Brothers, if someone is caught in a trespass, you who are spiritual should restore him with a spirit of gentleness."}, {"start_ms": 11482, "end_ms": 14382, "text": "But watch yourself, or you also may be tempted."}, {"start_ms": 15002, "end_ms": 19083, "text": "Carry one another’s burdens, and in this way you will fulfill the law of Christ."}, {"start_ms": 19923, "end_ms": 23523, "text": "If anyone thinks he is something when he is nothing, he deceives himself."}, {"start_ms": 24343, "end_ms": 26064, "text": "Each one should test his own work."}, {"start_ms": 26544, "end_ms": 30744, "text": "Then he will have reason to boast in himself alone, and not in someone else."}, {"start_ms": 31284, "end_ms": 33225, "text": "For each one should carry his own load."}, {"start_ms": 33865, "end_ms": 39206, "text": "Nevertheless, the one who receives instruction in the word must share in all good things with his instructor."}, {"start_ms": 40566, "end_ms": 43606, "text": "Do not be deceived: God is not to be mocked."}, {"start_ms": 44086, "end_ms": 46547, "text": "Whatever a man sows, he will reap in return."}, {"start_ms": 47207, "end_ms": 56328, "text": "The one who sows to please his flesh, from the flesh will reap destruction; but the one who sows to please the Spirit, from the Spirit will reap eternal life."}, {"start_ms": 57088, "end_ms": 62289, "text": "Let us not grow weary in well-doing, for in due time we will reap a harvest if we do not give up."}, {"start_ms": 62869, "end_ms": 68870, "text": "Therefore, as we have opportunity, let us do good to everyone, and especially to the family of faith."}, {"start_ms": 69910, "end_ms": 73631, "text": "See what large letters I am using to write to you with my own hand!"}, {"start_ms": 74311, "end_ms": 79091, "text": "Those who want to make a good impression outwardly are trying to compel you to be circumcised."}, {"start_ms": 79711, "end_ms": 83292, "text": "They only do this to avoid persecution for the cross of Christ."}, {"start_ms": 83892, "end_ms": 91153, "text": "For the circumcised do not even keep the law themselves, yet they want you to be circumcised that they may boast in your flesh."}, {"start_ms": 91893, "end_ms": 100794, "text": "But as for me, may I never boast, except in the cross of our Lord Jesus Christ, through which the world has been crucified to me, and I to the world."}, {"start_ms": 101475, "end_ms": 104955, "text": "For neither circumcision nor uncircumcision means anything."}, {"start_ms": 105355, "end_ms": 107235, "text": "What counts is a new creation."}, {"start_ms": 107956, "end_ms": 112416, "text": "Peace and mercy to all who walk by this rule, even to the Israel of God."}, {"start_ms": 113176, "end_ms": 118617, "text": "From now on let no one cause me trouble, for I bear on my body the marks of Jesus."}, {"start_ms": 119377, "end_ms": 122438, "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit, brothers."}, {"start_ms": 123298, "end_ms": 123638, "text": "Amen."}], "words": [{"t": "Galatians,", "s": 2040, "e": 2640, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2740, "e": 3040, "si": 0}, {"t": "Six.", "s": 3120, "e": 3340, "si": 0}, {"t": "Brothers,", "s": 4781, "e": 5201, "si": 1}, {"t": "if", "s": 5361, "e": 5461, "si": 1}, {"t": "someone", "s": 5561, "e": 5881, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 5921, "e": 6021, "si": 1}, {"t": "caught", "s": 6081, "e": 6321, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 6441, "e": 6521, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 6561, "e": 6581, "si": 1}, {"t": "trespass,", "s": 6681, "e": 7301, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 7621, "e": 7741, "si": 1}, {"t": "who", "s": 7801, "e": 7881, "si": 1}, {"t": "are", "s": 7961, "e": 8101, "si": 1}, {"t": "spiritual", "s": 8141, "e": 8701, "si": 1}, {"t": "should", "s": 8801, "e": 8981, "si": 1}, {"t": "restore", "s": 9021, "e": 9381, "si": 1}, {"t"